#: main.cpp:27
msgid "KDE's application finder"
msgstr "KDEs Programmsöker"

#: main.cpp:30
msgid "Install .desktop files into directory <dir>"
msgstr "Installeert de .desktop-Datein na den Ordner <dir>"

#: main.cpp:36 toplevel.cpp:50
msgid "KAppfinder"
msgstr "KAppfinder"

#: toplevel.cpp:53
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The application finder looks for non-KDE applications on your system and "
"adds them to the KDE menu system. Click 'Scan' to begin, select the desired "
"applications and then click 'Apply'."
msgstr ""
"Düt Programm söökt op dien Reekner na Programmen de nich Deel vun KDE "
"sünd und föögt de to dat KDE-Systeemmenü to. Klick op 'Söken' üm "
"antofangen, söök di de Programmen ut, de Du tofögen wullst und klick dann "
"op 'Anwennen'."

